            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to a suspension system with a rear rail 3, configured to be arranged on a wall or the like, and a hang standard 1 with rear leg portion 15 comprising suspension slots 17 arranged in each of the leg portions and being configured to connect with the lower flange of the rear rail. The rear rail further comprises an upper flange, and each of the hang standard leg portions comprise a mounting slot 19 adapted to connect with the upper flange of the rear rail. The upper and lower flanges at least partially extend in different directions.</p>
